，dialogue_ids 留空；下一阶段单镜结构化时再补动作与台词归属。", "米迦尔与伊恩保持面对面站位不变，仅通过景别与机位角度变化制造节奏；段末收束镜（32/40/48）均回到 MS/MLS 双人关系镜。", "本段承接前段：米迦尔与伊恩并肩立于码头栈桥，米迦尔在画面左、伊恩在画面右，两人连线为轴线（A→B：左→右）。", "180°轴线：全场机位保持在轴线同一侧（栈桥外侧水面一侧），任何相邻镜头机位角度变化 > 30°，或景别至少变化一档，避免跳切。", "银幕方向：船位于画面深处偏右（bg），米迦尔朝船方向（右→深），伊恩最后转身离开朝画面左（岸/市场方向），方向一经建立不得反转。", "镜号53握手为情绪顶点，此后关系由并肩转为分离：镜号54起机位逐步后退、景别放宽，形成松手节奏。", "镜号56船离岸后，镜号57–64为余韵段落：伊恩在船头回望（面向画面左），米迦尔在岸上目送（面向画面右），视线方向保持交叉不越轴。", "镜号58「两人的影子还在」与镜号61「市场重新热闹」按同一清晨时空连续处理，作为收束意象组。", "待确认项：台词与镜号的对应为按顺序推测（镜号50–61推进段），「我先上船」的说话人与谁上船存在矛盾，本计划按分镜表声明保留，仅标注 dialogue_ids，不做动作断言。", "所有镜头 movement 均为 static（分镜表声明），故以景别跳档 + 机位角度变化满足 30° 规则。"], "shots": [{"shot_id": "shot_001", "order": 1, "intent": "建立场景，交代市场全貌", "shot_type": "LS", "duration_frames": 72, "characters": ["米迦尔"], "dialogue_ids": [], "actions": [], "dialogues": [], "prompt": "远景建立镜头：第十四街区码头市场通道的午后全貌，摊位长桌与货箱沿通道两侧排开，远处港口水面与桅杆在逆光中泛白。米迦尔位于画面左侧，身体朝向右侧的通道深处，静止不动，仅有轻微呼吸起伏与一次缓慢的转头扫视市场。相机以固定机位从通道外侧斜向观察，50mm 镜头，轻微手持呼吸感，不做位移。构图上把米迦尔放在左三分线，右三分线留出伊恩未来入画的空位，形成画左—画右的轴线基准。不出现台词。", "camera": {"side": "front_right", "lens": 50}, "axis_note": "建立镜头，确立米迦尔画左、伊恩画右的轴线基准", "continuity_in": "段首，无前置镜头", "gaze": [{"from": "米迦尔", "to": "伊恩"}, {"from": "伊恩", "to": "米迦尔"}], "vfx": [], "declared_duration_frames": 0, "declared_shot_number": 1, "declared_camera_move": "static", "intent_type": "揭示", "dialogue_pins": [], "beats": [{"t": 0.0, "subject": "米迦尔", "verb": "look_at", "target": "摊位长桌与货箱", "face_to": "screen_right", "pace": "slow"}, {"t": 0.55, "subject": "米迦尔", "verb": "turn_head", "target": "港口水面与桅杆", "face_to": "away", "pace": "slow"}], "composition": {"rule": "thirds", "subject_position": "left_third"}, "rule_justifications": [{"rule": "AXIS_RULE", "action": "follow", "reason": "建立镜头，相机固定于通道一侧的斜前方，米迦尔画左、伊恩画右的轴线基准由此确立，全片不越轴。"}, {"rule": "INTENT_PACK", "action": "break", "reason": "计划指定本镜为 LS 建立镜头以交代市场全貌，与 intent:揭示 的 MS/CU/ECU/MCU 近景包冲突；此处以叙事优先，用远景一次性交代码头市场空间与两个站位锚点，为后续近景揭示提供地理依据。", "precedent": "case_20-years-children-men-how-london-locations-look-_014"}]}, {"shot_id": "shot_002", "order": 2, "intent": "交代两位主角的位置关系", "shot_type": "MS", "duration_frames": 96, "characters": ["米迦尔", "伊恩"], "dialogue_ids": [], "actions": [], "dialogues": [], "prompt": "中景双人镜头。第十四街区码头市场通道，午后侧光。机位较镜号1下移、贴近两人，从轴线同侧、以大于30°的新角度观察：米迦尔站在摊位长桌与货箱这一侧，面朝画面右侧的伊恩；伊恩稍靠后，半身被货箱边缘半遮，面朝画面左侧的米迦尔。背景是市场通道纵深与远处港口水面与桅杆。两人位置关系一目了然，中景景别、35mm 焦距、固定机位，头部留白按电影感处理，画面安静，为后续请战留出呼吸空间。", "camera": {"side": "front_right", "lens": 35}, "axis_note": "轴线同侧双人镜头，机位较镜号1下移且角度变化大于30°", "continuity_in": "承接镜号1市场全景，机位下移贴近两人", "gaze": [{"from": "米迦尔", "to": "伊恩"}, {"from": "伊恩", "to": "米迦尔"}], "vfx": [], "declared_duration_frames": 0, "declared_shot_number": 2, "declared_camera_move": "static", "intent_type": "铺垫", "dialogue_pins": [], "beats": [{"t": 0.0, "subject": "米迦尔", "verb": "stand", "target": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位", "face_to": "screen_right"}, {"t": 0.08, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "stand", "target": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位", "face_to": "screen_left"}, {"t": 0.3, "subject": "米迦尔", "verb": "turn_head", "target": "伊恩", "face_to": "screen_right"}, {"t": 0.42, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "look_at", "target": "米迦尔", "face_to": "screen_left"}, {"t": 0.62, "subject": "米迦尔", "verb": "nod", "target": "伊恩", "face_to": "screen_right"}, {"t": 0.8, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "turn_head", "target": "港口水面与桅杆", "face_to": "away"}], "composition": {"rule": "thirds", "subject_position": "right_third"}, "rule_justifications": [{"rule": "SHOT_PATTERN", "action": "follow"}, {"rule": "AXIS_RULE", "action": "follow"}, {"rule": "INTENT_PACK", "action": "follow"}]}, {"shot_id": "shot_003", "order": 3, "intent": "推进对话", "shot_type": "MS", "duration_frames": 72, "characters": ["米迦尔"], "dialogue_ids": [], "actions": [], "dialogues": [], "prompt": "米迦尔单人中景，位于摊位左侧，面向画右，身后是市场通道与人流", "camera": {}, "axis_note": "轴线同侧过肩方向单人镜，视线向画右", "continuity_in": "由镜号2双人镜切入米迦尔单人", "gaze": [{"from": "米迦尔", "to": "伊恩"}, {"from": "伊恩", "to": "米迦尔"}], "vfx": [], "declared_duration_frames": 0, "declared_shot_number": 3, "declared_camera_move": "static", "intent_type": "推进", "dialogue_pins": [], "beats": [], "composition": {}, "rule_justifications": []}, {"shot_id": "shot_004", "order": 4, "intent": "推进对话", "shot_type": "MCU", "duration_frames": 72, "characters": ["米迦尔"], "dialogue_ids": [], "actions": [], "dialogues": [], "prompt": "米迦尔胸部以上近景，面部朝画右，摊位货箱在前景边缘虚化", "camera": {}, "axis_note": "同一轴线，景别较镜号3收紧一档，机位角度微调", "continuity_in": "承接镜号3，景别收紧", "gaze": [{"from": "米迦尔", "to": "伊恩"}, {"from": "伊恩", "to": "米迦尔"}], "vfx": [], "declared_duration_frames": 0, "declared_shot_number": 4, "declared_camera_move": "static", "intent_type": "推进", "dialogue_pins": [], "beats": [], "composition": {}, "rule_justifications": []}, {"shot_id": "shot_005", "order": 5, "intent": "给出反应", "shot_type": "MCU", "duration_frames": 96, "characters": ["伊恩"], "dialogue_ids": [], "actions": [{"character_id": "伊恩", "action_type": "look_at", "start_frame": 1, "end_frame": 24, "params": {"yaw_deg": -18, "pitch_deg": -3}}, {"character_id": "伊恩", "action_type": "turn_head", "start_frame": 24, "end_frame": 44, "params": {"angle_deg": -8}}, {"character_id": "伊恩", "action_type": "nod", "start_frame": 48, "end_frame": 70, "params": {"cycles": 1}}, {"character_id": "伊恩", "action_type": "body_tilt", "start_frame": 70, "end_frame": 84, "params": {"angle_deg": 5, "axis": "x", "toward": "screen_left"}}], "dialogues": [{"character_id": "伊恩", "text": "这一次我听你的。", "start_frame": 30, "end_frame": 78}], "prompt": "第十四街区码头市场通道，午后。伊恩中近景（MCU），平视，50mm。他站在摊位长桌与货箱一侧，身体朝向米迦尔的方向，视线向画左——与前一镜米迦尔的反打形成同侧对切。相机位于伊恩前方偏左，缓慢推近（dolly_in），把注意力收拢到他脸上。伊恩开口说话，声音压得很低，说完后视线仍停在画左，喉头微动，像是在等一个回答。光线是码头午后的顶光，港口水面与桅杆在远处虚焦。", "camera": {"movements": [{"type": "dolly_in"}], "side": "front_left", "lens": 50}, "axis_note": "反打轴线同侧，伊恩视线向画左，与米迦尔视线形成对切", "continuity_in": "由米迦尔近景反打至伊恩近景", "gaze": [{"from": "伊恩", "to": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位"}], "vfx": [], "declared_duration_frames": 0, "declared_shot_number": 5, "declared_camera_move": "dolly_in", "intent_type": "推进", "dialogue_pins": [], "beats": [{"t": 0.0, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "look_at", "target": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}, {"t": 0.15, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "turn_head", "target": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}, {"t": 0.35, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "nod", "target": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}, {"t": 0.6, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "body_tilt", "target": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}], "composition": {"rule": "thirds", "subject_position": "right_third"}, "rule_justifications": [{"rule": "STAGING_PACK:shot_size=MCU composition_rule=balance camera_angle=平视", "action": "follow", "reason": "中近景平视，主体置于右三分位、视线向左留出对话空间，画面重量与米迦尔镜头对切保持平衡。"}, {"rule": "INTENT_PACK:intent=推进 shot_size=shot_size:MCU movement=dolly_in", "action": "follow", "reason": "本镜意图为给出反应，用 MCU 加 dolly_in 把压力缓慢压到伊恩脸上，与米迦尔镜头的推近节奏咬合。"}]}, {"shot_id": "shot_006", "order": 6, "intent": "铺垫冲突", "shot_type": "MS", "duration_frames": 72, "characters": ["米迦尔", "伊恩"], "dialogue_ids": [], "actions": [], "dialogues": [], "prompt": "第十四街区码头市场通道，午后。中景双人机位，回到轴线同侧，景别较上一镜伊恩近景放宽一档：米迦尔与伊恩并肩站在摊位长桌与货箱旁，背景是港口水面与桅杆。米迦尔先侧身面向通道深处，伊恩微微转向他，两人保持同一画面内的紧张距离，为接下来的分歧铺垫。镜头固定，35mm，电影感头部留白。", "camera": {"side": "front_left", "lens": 35}, "axis_note": "回到轴线同侧双人机位，景别较镜号5放宽一档", "continuity_in": "由伊恩近景拉回双人关系镜", "gaze": [{"from": "伊恩", "to": "米迦尔"}, {"from": "米迦尔", "to": "伊恩"}], "vfx": [], "declared_duration_frames": 0, "declared_shot_number": 6, "declared_camera_move": "static", "intent_type": "铺垫", "dialogue_pins": [], "beats": [{"t": 0.05, "subject": "米迦尔", "verb": "turn_body", "target": "第十四街区码头市场通道", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}, {"t": 0.3, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "turn_head", "target": "米迦尔", "face_to": "screen_right"}, {"t": 0.55, "subject": "米迦尔", "verb": "look_at", "target": "伊恩", "face_to": "screen_right"}, {"t": 0.8, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "body_tilt", "target": "米迦尔", "face_to": "screen_right", "pace": "slow"}], "composition": {"rule": "thirds", "subject_position": "left_third"}, "rule_justifications": [{"rule": "SHOT_PATTERN", "action": "follow"}, {"rule": "AXIS_RULE", "action": "follow"}, {"rule": "INTENT_PACK", "action": "follow"}]}, {"shot_id": "shot_007", "order": 7, "intent": "留白", "shot_type": "CU", "duration_frames": 48, "characters": ["伊恩"], "dialogue_ids": [], "actions": [], "dialogues": [], "prompt": "特写镜头，伊恩的正面近景。第十四街区码头市场通道的午后光线从他侧后方斜切进来，背景是虚化的摊位长桌与货箱轮廓，远处港口水面泛着碎光、桅杆竖成几道模糊的细线。伊恩面部占据画面中央偏右，头顶留白约画面高度 5%，平视机位，50mm 镜头，景深很浅，焦点落在他的眼睛上。整镜固定不动，没有推拉摇移——只有他极轻的一次呼吸起伏和一次缓慢的眨眼，眼神从米迦尔的方向移开后停在空中。沉默被完整地留在这里，为下一镜的爆发或告别积攒张力。", "camera": {"side": "front_right", "lens": 50}, "axis_note": "轴线同侧特写，机位角度较镜号6变化大于30°", "continuity_in": "由双人镜切入伊恩特写，突出沉默", "gaze": [{"from": "米迦尔", "to": "伊恩"}, {"from": "伊恩", "to": "米迦尔"}], "vfx": [], "declared_duration_frames": 0, "declared_shot_number": 7, "declared_camera_move": "static", "intent_type": "留白", "dialogue_pins": [], "beats": [{"t": 0, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "look_at", "target": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}, {"t": 0.45, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "turn_head", "target": "港口水面与桅杆", "face_to": "away", "pace": "slow"}, {"t": 0.8, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "nod", "target": "港口水面与桅杆", "face_to": "away", "pace": "slow"}], "composition": {"rule": "center", "subject_position": "center"}, "rule_justifications": [{"rule": "comp_headroom", "action": "follow", "reason": "特写头顶留白约 5%，落在 3%~12% 区间内，既不憋闷也不下坠。"}, {"rule": "INTENT_PACK", "action": "follow", "reason": "本镜 intent=留白，以固定机位、静止表演把沉默完整留在画面里；计划指定 CU 特写，取更具体的 CU 条目执行。"}, {"rule": "SHOT_PATTERN", "action": "break", "reason": "该条要求 MS + 50mm + zoom_in 且禁用 CU，与本镜计划指定的 CU 固定特写直接冲突；留白的叙事目的需要贴近伊恩的脸，任何运动都会削弱沉默，故按更具体的 INTENT_PACK/CU 条目执行。", "precedent": "case_rules-of-shot-composition-in-film_044"}, {"rule": "AXIS_RULE", "action": "follow", "reason": "机位保持在轴线同侧（front_right），与镜号 6 的双人机位角度差大于 30°，视线方向 screen_left 与米迦尔站位一致，未越轴。"}]}, {"shot_id": "shot_008", "order": 8, "intent": "段末收束", "shot_type": "MS", "duration_frames": 48, "characters": ["米迦尔"], "dialogue_ids": [], "actions": [], "dialogues": [], "prompt": "米迦尔中景，立于摊位左侧，身体正对画右，市场在他身后延续", "camera": {}, "axis_note": "轴线同侧单人镜，景别较镜号7放宽两档，形成段落收束", "continuity_in": "由伊恩特写切至米迦尔中景，段落收束", "gaze": [{"from": "米迦尔", "to": "伊恩"}, {"from": "伊恩", "to": "米迦尔"}], "vfx": [], "declared_duration_frames": 0, "declared_shot_number": 8, "declared_camera_move": "static", "intent_type": "收束", "dialogue_pins": [], "beats": [], "composition": {}, "rule_justifications": []}, {"shot_id": "shot_009", "order": 9, "intent": "推进主线", "shot_type": "MS", "duration_frames": 96, "characters": ["米迦尔", "伊恩"], "dialogue_ids": [], "actions": [{"character_id": "米迦尔", "action_type": "turn_head", "start_frame": 1, "end_frame": 20, "params": {"angle_deg": 30}}, {"character_id": "米迦尔", "action_type": "look_at", "start_frame": 20, "end_frame": 40, "params": {"yaw_deg": 28, "pitch_deg": -4}}, {"character_id": "伊恩", "action_type": "nod", "start_frame": 44, "end_frame": 62, "params": {"cycles": 2}}, {"character_id": "伊恩", "action_type": "turn_head", "start_frame": 68, "end_frame": 84, "params": {"angle_deg": -35}}, {"character_id": "米迦尔", "action_type": "body_tilt", "start_frame": 84, "end_frame": 92, "params": {"angle_deg": 6, "axis": "x", "toward": "伊恩"}}], "dialogues": [{"character_id": "米迦尔", "text": "我先上船。", "start_frame": 8, "end_frame": 48}, {"character_id": "伊恩", "text": "等等我。", "start_frame": 60, "end_frame": 84}], "prompt": "中景双人镜头。第十四街区码头市场通道，摊位长桌与货箱横在画面前景，米迦尔与伊恩并肩站在长桌后侧、靠近港口水面与桅杆的方向。午后硬光从水面方向斜切进来，两人的影子落在货箱上。米迦尔位于画面左三分，身体略朝伊恩，下巴微抬，语速短促；伊恩在右三分，稍落后半步，肩线朝米迦尔，视线先落在对方脸上，随后随对方的话转向码头通道深处。摄影机与镜号8同侧、但景别与角度双重变化，35mm 中景，轻微 push_through 向前压进，把两人的距离感一点点挤紧，收尾停在双人构图，为下一拍留出呼吸。", "camera": {"side": "front_left", "lens": 35}, "axis_note": "轴线同侧双人机位，与镜号8形成景别与角度双重变化", "continuity_in": "由米迦尔单人切回双人，开启新节拍", "gaze": [{"from": "米迦尔", "to": "伊恩"}, {"from": "伊恩", "to": "米迦尔"}], "vfx": [], "declared_duration_frames": 0, "declared_shot_number": 9, "declared_camera_move": "static", "intent_type": "推进", "dialogue_pins": [], "beats": [{"t": 0.0, "subject": "米迦尔", "verb": "turn_head", "target": "伊恩", "face_to": "screen_right", "pace": "normal"}, {"t": 0.15, "subject": "米迦尔", "verb": "look_at", "target": "伊恩", "face_to": "screen_right", "pace": "normal"}, {"t": 0.45, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "nod", "target": "米迦尔", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}, {"t": 0.7, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "turn_head", "target": "第十四街区码头市场通道", "face_to": "away", "pace": "slow"}, {"t": 0.9, "subject": "米迦尔", "verb": "body_tilt", "target": "伊恩", "face_to": "screen_right", "pace": "slow"}], "composition": {"rule": "thirds", "subject_position": "left_third"}, "rule_justifications": [{"rule": "SHOT_PATTERN shot_size=MS lens=35mm movement=push_through headroom_policy=cinematic", "action": "follow", "reason": "本镜为推进主线的中景双人，采用与镜号8同侧但景别与角度双变的35mm push_through，符合该模式对MS+35mm+推入的规定，且未使用被禁的orbit_cw。"}, {"rule": "INTENT_PACK intent=推进 shot_size=MS movement=push_through", "action": "follow", "reason": "意图为推进主线，选择push_through而非固定机位，与推进意图的更具体条目一致。"}, {"rule": "AXIS_RULE pair=any_two axis_side=neutral axis_topic=越轴", "action": "follow", "reason": "双人机位保持在轴线同侧（front_left），未越轴，故未使用被禁的固定机位造成的轴线漂移。"}]}, {"shot_id": "shot_010", "order": 10, "intent": "推进主线", "shot_type": "MCU", "duration_frames": 72, "characters": ["伊恩"], "dialogue_ids": [], "actions": [], "dialogues": [], "prompt": "第十四街区码头市场通道，午后。伊恩单人近景（MCU），85mm 镜头，平视，浅景深把背景的摊位长桌与货箱、远处港口水面与桅杆压成柔和虚焦。伊恩站在画面左三分之一处，身体朝画左，视线越过画左画框外，保持与镜号9双人镜同侧的轴线。镜头固定微推，伊恩下颌轻收，喉头动了一下，像是在把话咽回去，随后缓慢点头——一次，很轻。海风把衣角吹起一点。收尾留出余量，动作在第60帧前完成。", "camera": {"side": "front_right", "lens": 85}, "axis_note": "轴线同侧单人近景，视线保持向画左", "continuity_in": "由镜号9双人镜切入伊恩近景", "gaze": [{"from": "伊恩", "to": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位"}], "vfx": [], "declared_duration_frames": 0, "declared_shot_number": 10, "declared_camera_move": "static", "intent_type": "推进", "dialogue_pins": [], "beats": [{"t": 0.0, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "look_at", "target": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}, {"t": 0.3, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "body_tilt", "target": "第十四街区码头市场通道", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}, {"t": 0.55, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "nod", "target": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}, {"t": 0.85, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "look_at", "target": "港口水面与桅杆", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}], "composition": {"rule": "thirds", "subject_position": "left_third"}, "rule_justifications": [{"rule": "SHOT_PATTERN", "action": "follow", "reason": "镜头计划指定 MCU 近景、85mm 定焦、固定机位加轻微前推，符合近景人像的稳定取景；未使用 ECU。"}, {"rule": "STAGING_PACK", "action": "follow", "reason": "平视机位、平衡构图，主体置于左三分之一，为画左的视线方向留出空间。"}, {"rule": "AXIS_RULE", "action": "follow", "reason": "由镜号9双人镜切入单人近景，机位保持在轴线同侧，伊恩视线持续指向画左，未越轴。"}, {"rule": "INTENT_PACK", "action": "follow", "reason": "本镜 intent 为推进主线，采用 MCU 配合 dolly_in 的推进方案，与更具体的推进条目一致。"}]}, {"shot_id": "shot_011", "order": 11, "intent": "推进主线", "shot_type": "MCU", "duration_frames": 72, "characters": ["米迦尔"], "dialogue_ids": [], "actions": [{"character_id": "米迦尔", "action_type": "shake_head", "start_frame": 32, "end_frame": 50, "params": {"cycles": 1}}], "dialogues": [{"character_id": "米迦尔", "text": "我先上船。", "start_frame": 8, "end_frame": 48}], "prompt": "第十四街区码头市场通道，午后。米迦尔近景（MCU，85mm），与镜号10伊恩近景构成反打对切，轴线同侧。米迦尔立于摊位长桌与货箱一侧，身体朝画面左侧，视线越过长桌望向伊恩所在方向。他先开口\"我先上船。\"，说完下颌微收、目光略沉，随后短促地摇一下头，语气里带着不耐。背景是码头市场的货箱与远处港口水面、桅杆。相机固定，平视，构图以平衡为主，米迦尔置于画面右三分之一，左侧留出他与伊恩之间的对望空间。", "camera": {"side": "front_right", "lens": 85}, "axis_note": "反打轴线同侧，与镜号10构成对切", "continuity_in": "由伊恩近景反打至米迦尔近景", "gaze": [{"from": "米迦尔", "to": "伊恩"}], "vfx": [], "declared_duration_frames": 0, "declared_shot_number": 11, "declared_camera_move": "static", "intent_type": "推进", "dialogue_pins": [], "beats": [{"t": 0.05, "subject": "米迦尔", "verb": "look_at", "target": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "normal"}, {"t": 0.45, "subject": "米迦尔", "verb": "shake_head", "target": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}, {"t": 0.8, "subject": "米迦尔", "verb": "turn_head", "target": "港口水面与桅杆", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}], "composition": {"rule": "thirds", "subject_position": "right_third"}, "rule_justifications": [{"rule": "shot_size:MCU", "action": "follow"}, {"rule": "lens:85mm", "action": "follow"}, {"rule": "composition_rule:balance", "action": "follow"}, {"rule": "axis_side:neutral", "action": "follow", "reason": "本镜与镜号10伊恩近景构成反打对切，机位保持在轴线同侧，视线方向一致不越轴。"}, {"rule": "intent:推进 shot_size:MCU movement:dolly_in", "action": "follow", "reason": "推进主线，用极缓推近强调米迦尔先一步上船的决定，比'揭示/留白'条目更具体，故优先。"}]}, {"shot_id": "shot_012", "order": 12, "intent": "转折", "shot_type": "MCU", "duration_frames": 72, "characters": ["伊恩"], "dialogue_ids": [], "actions": [{"character_id": "伊恩", "action_type": "look_at", "start_frame": 4, "end_frame": 24, "params": {"yaw_deg": -18, "pitch_deg": -4}}, {"character_id": "伊恩", "action_type": "turn_head", "start_frame": 26, "end_frame": 44, "params": {"angle_deg": -12}}, {"character_id": "伊恩", "action_type": "nod", "start_frame": 46, "end_frame": 58, "params": {"cycles": 1}}], "dialogues": [], "prompt": "中近景（MCU），50mm 镜头，平视机位，固定。伊恩位于第十四街区码头市场通道中，身后是摊位长桌与货箱，纵深尽头可见港口水面与桅杆。构图取平衡，伊恩落在画面右侧三分之一，视线朝画面左侧（米迦尔与伊恩的站位方向）留出视线空间。开场他下颌微收、目光低垂，随即抬眼看向画面左侧的米迦尔方向，眼神一沉、嘴唇抿紧——这是他从犹豫到决断的转折瞬间。海风轻动衣领，逆光勾出轮廓，背景浅虚。机位与镜号 11 同侧但角度变化超过 30°，保持轴线不越。", "camera": {"side": "front_right", "lens": 50}, "axis_note": "轴线同侧，机位角度较镜号11变化大于30°", "continuity_in": "由米迦尔近景切回伊恩，情绪转折点", "gaze": [{"from": "伊恩", "to": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位"}], "vfx": [], "declared_duration_frames": 0, "declared_shot_number": 12, "declared_camera_move": "static", "intent_type": "转折", "dialogue_pins": [], "beats": [{"t": 0.05, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "look_at", "target": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}, {"t": 0.35, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "turn_head", "target": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}, {"t": 0.6, "subject": "伊恩", "verb": "nod", "target": "米迦尔与伊恩的站位", "face_to": "screen_left", "pace": "slow"}], "composition": {"rule": "thirds", "subject_position": "right_third"}, "rule_justifications": [{"rule": "shot_size:MCU", "action": "follow"}, {"rule": "lens:85mm", "action": "break", "reason": "本镜为情绪转折点，需要保留码头市场通道与港口桅杆的环境纵深，让伊恩的决断发生在真实空间里而非被长焦压平；50mm 在 MCU 距离下仍能给出面部细节，同时交代他与米迦尔之间的空间关系。", "precedent": "case_ultimate-guide-to-camera-shots_024"}, {"rule": "movement:固定", "action": "follow"}, {"rule": "composition_rule:balance", "action": "follow"}, {"rule": "composition_rule:framing", "action": "follow"}, {"rule": "intent:转折", "action": "break", "reason": "intent:转折 的 INTENT_PACK 要求 MS，但本镜是米迦尔近景之后切回伊恩的情绪转折点，必须让观众看清他眼神由躲闪到坚定的变化，故坚持 MCU；景别收紧本身就是这次转折的表演手段。", "precedent": "case_75_075"}]}, {"shot_id": "shot_013", "order": 13, "intent": "转折", "shot_type": "MS", "duration_frames": 72, "characters": ["米迦尔", "伊恩"], "dialogue_ids": [], "actions": [{"character_id": "米迦尔", "action_type": "walk_to", "start_frame": 56, "end_frame": 72, "target_position": [6.6, -6.2, 4.5], "params": {"speed": "walk", "from": [6.9, -6.5, 4.5], "to": [6.6, -6.2, 4.5], "bob": 0.02}}, {"character_id": "米迦尔", "action_type": "shake_head", "start_frame": 28, "end_frame": 44, "params": {"cycles": 1}}, {"character_id": "伊恩", "action_type": "nod", "start_frame": 44, "end_frame": 56, "params": {"cycles": 1}}], "dialogues": [{"character_id": "米迦尔", "text": "我先上船。", "start_frame": 6, "end_frame": 46}, {"character_id": "伊恩", "text": "等等我。", "start_frame": 58, "end_frame": 60}], "prompt": "中景双人镜，第十四街区码头市场通道。摊位长桌与货箱横在画面中段，米迦尔与伊恩分立长桌两侧，间距比上一镜的近景放宽一档，两人都完整入画。米迦尔站在画面左侧、身体朝右，伊恩在画面右侧、身体朝左，视线在两人之间来回。午后顶光偏侧，货箱与长桌投下短影，背景可见港口水面与桅杆。相机在轴线同侧固定不动，35mm 焦距，中景景别，视线高度，头顶留白克制。米迦尔先开口示意自己先上船，伊恩随即侧头转向他；米迦尔轻轻摇头、语气不容拖延，伊恩点头应下，米迦尔转身朝码头方向迈出一步，伊恩视线追随。", "camera": {"side": "front_left", "lens": 35}, "axis_note": "轴线同侧双人机位，景别较镜号12放宽一档", "continuity_in": "由伊恩近景回到双人关系镜", "gaze": [{"from": "米迦尔", "to": "伊恩"}, {"from": "伊恩", "to": "米迦尔"}], "vfx": [], "declared_duration_frames": 0, "declared_shot_number": 13, "declared_camera_move": "static", "intent_type": "转折", "dialogue_pins": [], "beats": [{"t